              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akuj ŋina akainaki ayoŋ daŋ amina keŋ ŋina nyiryaŋiryaŋa alokiŋaren erwosit ka ŋulu iŋarakinito iŋes anakipuka ta alokiŋaren ŋikapolok daadaŋ ŋulu agogoŋok ŋulu ipukato kaapei ka erwosit. Abu ayoŋ nyakuryaniar, anerae ekeŋarakinit Ekapolon Akuj kaŋ, ido abu ayoŋ ocunak ŋikarikok alo Isirael aŋuna ka akitipeiyor kaapei ka ayoŋ.",
